                    "exact": "Marianne Moore",
                    "prefix": " That the editors have chosen to bring together,\n\t\t\t\t\twithin the same covers, fifteen writers as diverse as Dorothy Parker\n\t\t\t\t\tand Nadine Gordimer,",
